            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "juhnke"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a refreshing treat for the whole family! I used sweetened condensed milk instead of evaporated milk, didn't use the sugar and used 1/2 the water. Poured it into popsickle molds for my daughter. Turned out to be a great snack without too much sugar."
          },
          {
